---
layout: base.njk
title: "Resources"
navPage: "resources"
permalink: "/resources/index.html"
metaDescription: "Freely available texts, study aids, paintings, and multimedia to support your study of the Agni Yoga teachings."
---

<header>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="section-label on-dark">Open Access</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">Resources</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-subtitle">Freely available texts, study aids, and multimedia materials to support your study of the teachings.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main-content" style="background:var(--bg);padding:4rem 3rem;">
  <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
    <section aria-labelledby="resources-start-heading" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 3rem auto;text-align:center;">
      <div class="section-label" style="text-align:center;">Beginner Pathway</div>
      <h2 id="resources-start-heading" class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom:1.2rem;">Start with the Teaching, then deepen your study</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.85;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">If you are new to Agni Yoga, first read the overview of the Living Ethics Teaching, then use these resources for independent study or group discussion.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/what-is-agni-yoga/">Start Learning Agni Yoga</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/community/">Find a Study Group</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid-3" id="texts">
      {% for resource in collections.resources %}
      <{% if resource.data.link %}a href="{{ resource.data.link }}"{% if resource.data.external %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}{% else %}div{% endif %} class="card">
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2>{{ resource.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ resource.data.description }}</p>
        {% if resource.data.link %}
        <div style="color:var(--accent);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:1.2rem;">{{ resource.data.link_text if resource.data.link_text else "View →" }}</div>
        {% endif %}
      </{% if resource.data.link %}a{% else %}div{% endif %}>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
